The [[Online (open beta)|online beta]] received a patch on February 1st, 2024, announced on [https://twitter.com/tyronerodriguez/status/1752949244594647158 Twitter].

== Documented Changes ==
* Minor fixes for Emote menu
* HUD tweaks and fixes
* Revive machine tweaks

== Undocumented changes ==
* {{c|Jacob and Esau}} were given a new toggle in the options menu labelled "Jacob+Esau Controls" with the choices being "Classic" or "Better".

